                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d236fbf0-8118-3e61-addd-271bd6901976",
                                        "entry_id": "2352e382-e156-3e44-ace1-5de53b6ef38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having hidden (unapparent) meaning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "93ade300-866a-3043-9fb4-db18c31813f2",
                                        "entry_id": "2352e382-e156-3e44-ace1-5de53b6ef38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mystified or of an obscure nature; not easy to perceive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5f44f05-3ca8-4e4b-80f7-1af0018b5f36",
                                                "sense_id": "93ade300-866a-3043-9fb4-db18c31813f2",
                                                "text": "I think the Original of this conceit might be, That the Students of Nature, conſcious to her more cryptick wayes of working, reſolve many ſtrange effects into the nearer efficiency of ſecond cauſes[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52cda538-85a3-4a47-8262-acd49b7d5b37",
                                                "sense_id": "93ade300-866a-3043-9fb4-db18c31813f2",
                                                "text": "Even the putatively innocuous whimsical shapes and designs of cakes and pastry, notably in Central Europe, retain to this day the phallic concept, the cryptic induration of the aphrodisiac function."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "829ce383-88b0-328b-b925-267c4690ca70",
                                        "entry_id": "2352e382-e156-3e44-ace1-5de53b6ef38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Involving use of a code or cipher."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9142739f-7fba-3efb-8cca-366ef0bcbb8a",
                                        "entry_id": "2352e382-e156-3e44-ace1-5de53b6ef38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a crossword puzzle, or a clue in such a puzzle, using, in addition to definitions, wordplay such as anagrams, homophones and hidden words to indicate solutions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4e3d45c-1169-3237-9f65-fdea8c5f082c",
                                        "entry_id": "2352e382-e156-3e44-ace1-5de53b6ef38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Well camouflaged; having good camouflage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d702fda7-b391-4da5-9b87-43a9e092c68c",
                                                "sense_id": "f4e3d45c-1169-3237-9f65-fdea8c5f082c",
                                                "text": "Lonomia caterpillars are extremely cryptic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a96a1ce-e5ba-33d2-8259-aa3daf41d27e",
                                        "entry_id": "2352e382-e156-3e44-ace1-5de53b6ef38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Serving as camouflage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1d31353-102f-4c7c-a286-f761addced23",
                                                "sense_id": "4a96a1ce-e5ba-33d2-8259-aa3daf41d27e",
                                                "text": "cryptic colouring"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d678d18d-c4c7-4d3f-a373-767a9e4daadb",
                                                "sense_id": "4a96a1ce-e5ba-33d2-8259-aa3daf41d27e",
                                                "text": "Episematic characters are far less common than aposematic, and these than cryptic; although, as regards the latter comparison, the opposite impression is generally produced from the fact that concealment is so successfully attained."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ac997ec-c949-3bbf-8c31-3b962d893c3b",
                                        "entry_id": "2352e382-e156-3e44-ace1-5de53b6ef38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Apparently identical, but actually genetically distinct."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56402b45-f5ca-43b0-9d95-bd1baaa90f66",
                                                "sense_id": "3ac997ec-c949-3bbf-8c31-3b962d893c3b",
                                                "text": "cryptic species"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0bbce157-9f9c-3bd6-9dfa-60c9ae3fe327",
                                        "entry_id": "2352e382-e156-3e44-ace1-5de53b6ef38d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Living in a cavity or small cave."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "259cc18b-eb08-49ac-b859-5e3e277d2d09",
                                                "sense_id": "0bbce157-9f9c-3bd6-9dfa-60c9ae3fe327",
                                                "text": "Much of the Permian Capitan reef was strongly differentiated into open surface and cryptic communities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
